# Denali operator parity (P5-B)

Prove **package path ≡ metadata path** for Denali operator workflows when tenant is on pilot/live cutover — **without** deleting or moving `packages/workspaces/denali` rules/composites/UI.

**Doc SoT:** this file · **Nano spec:** [`TEMP/p5/p5-b-denali-operator-parity.md`](../../TEMP/p5/p5-b-denali-operator-parity.md) v2.0

**Status (2026-06-21):** doc complete · implementation after P5-A pilot

---

## Executive summary

| Layer | P5-B delivers |
|-------|----------------|
| **Lifecycle** | Tour FSM transitions + publish readiness gates on metadata path |
| **Validation** | Draft-relaxed vs publish-strict split |
| **Operator web** | Resolve workspace plugin from tenant binding when flag on |
| **Audit** | PATCH + publish events (extend DEC-007 scope) |
| **Preservation** | PC-01..10 gate spec — wizard · clone · list · settings · receipts unchanged |
| **P5-core exit** | `P5-B-N-016` |

---

## Critical rule (frozen — AI STOP if violated)

```text
Parity implementation lives in apps/api/src/canonical/ + specs.
Metadata DB holds layout/ruleSet SNAPSHOT merged by adapter.
NEVER delete or “port by removal” denali/src/rules|field-registry|composites|ui.
```

Denali commerce remains **`offline_receipt` only** — receipt upload + admin review unchanged.

---

## Operator product preservation matrix

| ID | Surface | Must pass after P5-B |
|----|---------|-------------------|
| PC-01 | Create wizard | Golden tour validates on metadata path |
| PC-02 | Clone (`?clone=` + server clone) | Hydrate envelope identical |
| PC-03 | Template / preset | Template gate + prefill unchanged |
| PC-04 | Tour list projection | `extractDenaliTourListProjection` output match |
| PC-05 | Settings ×9 modules | Manifest routes + abilities unchanged |
| PC-06 | Finance receipts | POST upload + PATCH review |
| PC-07 | offline_receipt | Tour canonical paymentMode |
| PC-08 | Draft persistence | `operator.wizard` namespace |
| PC-09 | Composites UI | Widget registry + theme |
| PC-10 | Public catalog hooks | P4 publish → catalog chain |

Spec: `apps/api/test/p5-preservation-gate.spec.ts` (P5-B-N-014).

